{"text": "On Sunday, Ani visits her grandma. Today they are making gata, a sweet Armenian pastry. Grandma mixes the flour, butter and sugar, and Ani rolls out the dough. There is flour on the table, on her hands and even on her nose! Grandma laughs. Soon the kitchen smells wonderful. When the gata is ready, they drink tea and eat it together. 'Your gata is the best,' says Ani.", "words": [[0.48, 0.6], [0.74, 1.2], [1.72, 1.96], [2.12, 2.48], [2.52, 2.62], [2.7, 3.18], [4.74, 5.08], [5.18, 5.3], [5.36, 5.46], [5.5, 5.86], [5.96, 6.36], [6.88, 6.91], [7.06, 7.4], [7.7, 8.22], [8.32, 8.9], [10.4, 10.84], [11.06, 11.5], [11.56, 11.64], [11.74, 12.16], [12.52, 12.84], [12.92, 13.02], [13.14, 13.48], [14.02, 14.1], [14.2, 14.42], [14.6, 15.0], [15.08, 15.24], [15.3, 15.4], [15.46, 15.8], [17.2, 17.36], [17.38, 17.48], [17.58, 17.98], [18.08, 18.16], [18.2, 18.28], [18.38, 18.82], [19.22, 19.3], [19.36, 19.48], [19.58, 20.04], [20.46, 20.56], [20.68, 20.9], [21.02, 21.1], [21.18, 21.3], [21.4, 21.9], [23.26, 23.8], [24.1, 24.66], [26.08, 26.34], [26.42, 26.5], [26.58, 27.0], [27.34, 27.86], [28.04, 28.62], [29.98, 30.08], [30.12, 30.18], [30.24, 30.6], [30.72, 30.82], [30.92, 31.16], [31.7, 31.82], [31.88, 32.14], [32.26, 32.52], [32.7, 32.82], [32.98, 33.12], [33.18, 33.26], [33.32, 33.74], [33.82, 35.36], [35.44, 35.82], [36.02, 36.12], [36.18, 36.28], [36.38, 36.94], [37.18, 37.4], [37.54, 38.088]], "tag": "kokoro:bm_george", "pace": "v2-slow", "fx": "pb1", "aligned": "ctc1", "clamped": 1}